{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上方第一段的大字号文字，尤其是珊瑚红高亮的“自己需要对方”和“不再藏起喜欢”；随后容易被第二段黄色高亮的“顾不上害臊”“我不再为它道歉”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"意识到自己需要对方，开始坦然承认并表达喜欢。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"欢喜、坦然、不再羞愧。\",\n  \"missed\": \"对方有时也需要他，以及即使对方不需要也愿意陪伴；更重要的是，想到两人未必能一直亲近，欢喜中其实夹杂着心痛和不安。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方第一段和第二段都是大字号、高亮重点突出，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上方两段和下方灰色文字中，需要拼接才能理解处境与感受之间的完整关系。\",\n    \"单块文字较长，一段内部包含好几层意思，不能只靠高亮词完整判断。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cf14ee37-996e-4f2e-aa83-369e2de804dd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T021714401496Z", "elapsed_seconds": 28.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:17:42.461011+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8d905294361783c4881928799a925eb495c8b295d78259018152b5fad4cf0203", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "t